WEBVTT

18:31.351 --> 18:33.394
He's not a Space Ranger!

18:33.479 --> 18:37.148
He doesn't fight evil
or, or shoot lasers or fly!

18:37.232 --> 18:38.649
Excuse me.

18:40.736 --> 18:43.154
Oh, impressive wingspan!
Very good!

18:43.238 --> 18:47.992
Oh, what? What?
These are plastic. He can't fly!

18:48.077 --> 18:51.537
They are a terillium-carbonic alloy,
and I can fly.

18:51.622 --> 18:54.916
-No, you can't.
-Yes, I can.

18:55.000 --> 18:56.000
-You can't.
-Can.

18:56.085 --> 18:57.794
Can't. Can't. Can't!

18:57.878 --> 19:00.338
I tell you, I could fly around
this room with my eyes closed!
